---
title: Visual Memory and Editing Target
---
flowchart TB
    User([User]) --> Request{Create, recall,<br/>or edit an image?}

    subgraph Current[Implemented foundation]
        Generate[Generate with HiDream]
        Edit[Edit owned pixels<br/>with FLUX]
        Artifact[Immutable image revision<br/>with lineage and SHA-256]
        PixelIndex[(Nomic pixel-vector index)]
        Generate --> Artifact
        Edit --> Artifact
        Artifact --> PixelIndex
    end

    subgraph Planned[Planned memory-aware stages]
        Observe[1. Gemma VLM observation<br/>objects, attributes and OCR]
        Semantic[(Typed observations<br/>and semantic vectors)]
        Resolve[2. Resolve alias, meaning,<br/>conversation and recency]
        Clarify{One confident<br/>owned match?}
        Verify[3. Compare requested change<br/>with preserved content]
        Promote{4. Promote candidate<br/>or keep parent}
        Observe --> Semantic --> Resolve --> Clarify
        Verify --> Promote
    end

    Request -->|create| Generate
    Request -->|recall| Resolve
    Request -->|edit| Resolve
    Artifact -. ready event .-> Observe
    PixelIndex --> Resolve
    Clarify -->|ambiguous| Choice[Ask user to choose]
    Clarify -->|matched edit| Edit
    Edit -. candidate .-> Verify
    Promote -. accepted .-> Artifact
    Promote -->|rejected| Failure[Visible failure;<br/>parent remains current]
    Artifact --> UI[Show current image<br/>and revision history]
    Choice --> UI
    Failure --> UI

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef implemented fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef planned fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b78b20,color:#4d3900,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
    class User,Request,Choice,Failure,UI interface;
    class Generate,Edit,Artifact implemented;
    class PixelIndex data;
    class Observe,Semantic,Resolve,Clarify,Verify,Promote planned;
